SmartCatAI DSH Plugins
======================
This repository contains two DSH web client plugins:

  - @smartcatai/castep-progress         CASTEP 作业进度（筛选/排序/路径管理）
  - @smartcatai/castep-structure-viewer CASTEP 结构查看（three.js 逐帧 + 动画）

Third-party acknowledgements
----------------------------
- `@linxin666/dsh-ssh` (Apache-2.0, part of @linxin666/dsh-web-all)
  - Both plugins talk to the DSH loopback HTTP API `/api/dsh-ssh/*`
    (exec / hosts) provided by `@linxin666/dsh-ssh`.

- `dsh-better-sidebar` (MIT)
  - Both plugins register their UI as Tabs into `ctx.betterSidebar`
    (the right-sidebar panel provided by dsh-better-sidebar).

- `three.js` (MIT License)
  - Used by `@smartcatai/castep-structure-viewer` for 3D structure rendering.

- Symmetry Viewer (H5, three.js)
  - The 3D structure / animation rendering approach in
    `castep-structure-viewer` draws inspiration/patterns from the
    "Symmetry Viewer" project (`D:\xjl\program\Symmetry Viewer\H5`),
    specifically its `render/scene-builder.js` ball-stick / crystal approach.
